        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1020"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts128" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts129">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1024"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts134" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts135">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What do I feel might be the hardest thing for you being my son? And what advice do I have?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1026"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts136" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts137">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I think that what could be challenging is</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1027"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts138" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts139">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>you know,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1028"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts140" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts143">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>finding your way that's not attached to what either myself or your dad has created. And for it to not be something that somehow kind of follows you or you feel or other people feel, that is somehow something you have to measure yourself to in any way. You know, when you are the son of people that have done certain things. You know, it's always kind of a part of the conversation. And I think sometimes that could be annoying because you're like, this is my life. Like this is, this is my thing. I don't know. We've honestly actually never even talked about this to be honest.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a354"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts146" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts147">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Like, so I don't even know how that touches you or doesn't touch you actually, but I think that that could be difficult.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a355"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts148" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts150">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And my advice for that would just be like, you know, there's nobody like you. There's literally nobody like you. No one's going to think how you think. No one's going to write how you write. Nobody's going to dream how you dream. No one's going to execute how you execute. And you just keep on being like this unique person that you are. I just don't see any limits for you in any way. And I really don't, not even as it relates to anything that might come up in regards to being the son of me and your dad. You know what I mean? I really don't. I don't personally see that</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1046"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts152" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts153">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I didn't feel that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1048"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts155" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts157">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I agree.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1051"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts160" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts161">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I love that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1055"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts168" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts169">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Listen you have gratitude. You have everything that you need. Like everything that you need. Everything I know comes from that. So I love to hear you say that because that's literally the magic. That's the magic rule that people don't know. They don't know that if they just are grateful and give thanks for even that small step, that one step that they took that's brought them from there to there.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1056"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts170" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts172">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You give thanks for that. Then the steps get bigger and they get because the universe knows you're ready for like things more profound.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1060"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts173" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts175">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I love that so much! I never asked you that question,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1061"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts176" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts177">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>because I never felt like I actually had to ask you that question. But then when that card came up, I was like, well, damn. I never asked him the question, like, what if it actually does, you know?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1062"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts180" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts181">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So I'm so happy to hear that. Like, I'm really I'm really happy to hear that. That was fire.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1064"
