                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts224" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts225">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Wow.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1087"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts227" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts230">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That's my type of question.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1088"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts231" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts235">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It’s my type of question.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1091"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts236" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts237">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>The key to opening the soul to one's heart.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1092"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts238" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts239">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You have to... You have to listen to yourself.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1093"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts242" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts243">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know? You have to start to be unafraid to get to know yourself.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1095"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts244" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts245">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You have to like quiet the noise of everybody else is so noisy. Everybody has an opinion. Everybody's trying to tell you what to do and how to do it, and what's good for you and what's not good for you. And so much fear in the world. And there's so much fear everywhere we look, and there's so much stereotyping, and we're stuck in a matrix and we don't even know what's real and what's fake. And we judge ourselves for stuff that's not that doesn't even matter. And we don't have any connection to the spirit. We don't have any connection to something bigger.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1096"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts246" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts248">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so the only way to open the key to your soul is to, like, be brave enough to start to know, who am I? Who? Who am I? What do I actually think when that question is asked? Or what do I actually want to do in this situation? You know? Is it meant for me? Is it good for me? Is it right for me? Is it scaring me? Should I proceed? Do I feel... can I... Do I want to because I want to, not because someone said, but if you do it, you're going to get this. Or if you don't do it, you're going to get this. You know? It's like... And so I think that opening your soul comes from learning who you are. And you have to get in, you have to tune into you. And it takes a minute to like, figure out who that is. But when you start doing that, your whole thing opens and then you're just like standing in your power. I love that question.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1097"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts250" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts252">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes!</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1100"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts254" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts255">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What do I do that makes you feel truly seen?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1101"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts258" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts259">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Mhm.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1106"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts268" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts271">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I feel that, and I'm sitting here as you're talking. I'm seeing us in the car and the sun is setting and we're outside the monster restaurant that looks scary. And we just, we're by ourselves. And for that moment, you were, like, able to unload on me some things that you were just like, I feel, you know, this is happening and I'm feeling this. And I just felt so grateful that we could just sit there in that moment in silence, and I could just listen and hear you, and maybe I could offer, like, a thought or a thing, but mostly I don't even want to.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1112"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts272" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts273">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And that, to me, reflects our relationship. Reading the book, karate chopping, sun setting, monster restaurant, weird moments that suddenly become, like, so personal. And just like, that's the moments where I feel like I see you and you see me, and we're just like, there.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1114"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts278" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts279">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We're pretty fresh.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1124"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts281" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts283">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I mean, like...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1115"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts288" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts289">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Thank God for bringing you into my life.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1125"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts292" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts293">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I love you, man.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
