        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a963"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts16" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts19">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You're like, you're like, okay, so first, we're gonna go to Pilates and then we're gonna go get a smoothie and then I'm gonna refill my water bottle. and then I'm going to go to rehearsal. And then I'm going to go pick your brother up from school. And then I'm going to come back, and then we're gonna have lunch, and then we're gonna have dinner.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
