                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>for sure. That's what I first That's what I first thought of. But again, that's like imbued in you already. So it's not like you do it to make me feel seen. It's just something that you do, you know? And I really love that part of our relationship. Really, really, really.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
